<title>UK: Cofinoga sets 300 mln mark seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Cofinoga sets 300 mln mark seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Paribas, Frankfurt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COFINOGA SA</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    AUGUST.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +12.5 BP  PAY DATE    13.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  99.92     FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> REOFFER    99.92</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    7.5 BP    SELL CONC  12.5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**FR/DE/US/UK</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
